.L.str.369:
        .asciz  "Fill rows from wall to wall: a full row goes, and every ten rows the pieces fall faster.\n\nLeft and Right move the piece, Up turns it (Z the other way), Down drops it faster and Space drops it at once.\n\nP pauses, F2 starts a new game."
        .size   .L.str.369, 234
        .type   .L.str.370,@object
